battery is super and sound is terrificFast delivery by Flipkart thanks","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"BoAt Airdopes 131 Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"475a1bcbee494f0f8c0bf48fed9d5c5d","content":"As they rightly say about Chinese Products: Chala Toh Chand Tak; Nahi Toh Raat Tak.Review after a month of using this product:Sound Quality Is good, above average I would call it.Easy to pair and connect.Like the fit, fits perfect in your ears.Issues: 1. If you are watching a video, after a while, you would notice that the video is not in sync with the sound. Theres a constant disconnect which cause the video to relay first and then u hear the audio.2. The right earbud has stopped wo...","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"realme Buds Q Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"63c720d4c9724c68a9a62ec7af3da204","content":"Best Quality buds","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"realme Buds Q Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"1d102b8ee4e741acb7f44aa994375b88","content":"Excellent product under such a tight budget...Overall great experience till nowHowever the left earphone gets discharged earlier everytime than the right one even if I overcharge the left one separately or in pairGives a continuous playback of 3.5 hrs microphone is also awesome5 star for the product","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"BoAt Airdopes 131 Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"85c02b15a91e43829295ff5c054ad535","content":"Lovely colour and premium looking and connectivity is awesome and impressive better than 3k-4k rs headphones    Trust without and double thought go for it","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"realme Buds Wireless Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"00ca8ba6f0644b9eb9895a9f1d96c446","content":"in love with realme products .. Good thank you flipkart  &realme good experience with realme x2 pro with this headphone..","$vector":{"$binary":""},"metadata":{"product_name":"realme Buds Wireless Bluetooth Headset"}},{"_id":"a8eaac9a8132